{"type":"message_update","assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"thinking_end","contentIndex":0,"content":"Now `check.go`. Define:\n- `IsPIReady() (bool, []string)`\n- `CheckReady() []string`\n- `CheckPIInstalled() []string`\n- `CheckEcosystemExtensions() []string`\n- `CheckRickAgents() []string`\n- `CheckRickHooks() []string`\n\nLet me define the semantics precisely:\n\n```go\nfunc CheckReady() []string {\n    var missing []string\n    missing = append(missing, CheckPIInstalled()...)\n    missing = append(missing, CheckEcosystemExtensions()...)\n    missing = append(missing, CheckRickAgents()...)\n    missing = append(missing, CheckRickHooks()...)\n    return missing\n}\n\nfunc IsPIReady() (bool, []string) {\n    missing := CheckReady()\n    return len(missing) == 0, missing\n}\n```\n\n`CheckPIInstalled() []string`:\n```go\nfunc CheckPIInstalled() []string {\n    if runtime.FileExists(runtime.RuntimeBin()) {\n        return nil\n    }\n    if _, err := exec.LookPath(\"pi\"); err == nil {\n        return nil\n    }\n    return []string{\"pi runtime not installed\"}\n}\n```\n\n`CheckEcosystemExtensions() []string`:\n```go\nfunc CheckEcosystemExtensions() []string {\n    return VerifyExtensions()\n}\n```\n\n`CheckRickAgents() []string`:\n```go\nvar requiredRickAgents = []string{} // task9 注册 think/research/exporter\n\nfunc CheckRickAgents() []string {\n    var missing []string\n    for _, name := range requiredRickAgents {\n        if !runtime.FileExists(filepath.Join(runtime.AgentDir(), \"agents\", name)) {\n            missing = append(missing, name)\n        }\n    }\n    return missing\n}\n```\n\nWait — but with `requiredRickAgents` empty, `CheckRickAgents` always returns nil. That's fine for task3. But is this semantically right? Let me reconsider what \"agent\" file path looks like. In task9, the agents will be written to `AgentDir()/agents/`. The exact filenames aren't defined yet (think/research/exporter). I'll use a marker file per agent, e.g., `agents/think.md` or `agents/think/`. \n\nActually, let me keep it simple: `requiredRickAgents` is a list of agent names, and I check for `AgentDir()/agents/<name>` (a file or dir). In task3 it's empty, so check passes trivially. Task9 will populate `requiredRickAgents` and write the files.\n\nHmm, but wait — the test method says `CheckRickAgents` should return \"nil/空切片\" when ready. With empty required list, it returns nil always. That's consistent.\n\nBut actually, there's a subtle issue: the test method also says \"`IsPIReady()` 返回 ok=true、missing 为空，且 CheckPIInstalled/CheckEcosystemExtensions/CheckRickAgents/CheckRickHooks 各自就绪\". So my `TestIsPIReady` needs all four to return empty. `CheckRickAgents` returns empty (trivially). Good.\n\n`CheckRickHooks() []string`:\n```go\nfunc CheckRickHooks() []string {\n    p := filepath.Join(runtime.AgentDir(), \"extensions\", \"rick-gates\", \"helper.py\")\n    if !runtime.FileExists(p) {\n        return []string{\"rick-gates\"}\n    }\n    return nil\n}\n```\n\nThis requires helper.py to be deployed. In `TestIsPIReady`, I need to deploy it (or write it directly).\n\nNow, let me think about whether `CheckRickAgents` should return empty even though there's no `agents/` dir. Yes, because `requiredRickAgents` is empty. This is correct for task3.\n\nLet me write check.go."}}
{"type":"message_update","assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"toolcall_end","contentIndex":1,"toolCall":{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_hTO7qLyScHwr7iIg7HQw2665","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"package env\n\nimport (\n\t\"os/exec\"\n\t\"path/filepath\"\n\n\t\"github.com/sunquan/rick/internal/runtime\"\n)\n\n// requiredRickAgents 是 rick 自定义 agent 的清单（对应 AgentDir()/agents/<name>）。\n// task3 保持为空：think/research/exporter 由 task9 经职责 3 落盘并在此注册。\n// 空清单下 CheckRickAgents 恒为就绪（无必需 agent）。\nvar requiredRickAgents = []string{}\n\n// IsPIReady 汇总所有功能点就绪判定，返回 (ok, missing)。ok=true 且 missing 为空\n// 表示 pi 环境就绪。纯「功能点就绪」，不含任何 session 校验（session 归 runtime）。\nfunc IsPIReady() (bool, []string) {\n\tmissing := CheckReady()\n\treturn len(missing) == 0, missing\n}\n\n// CheckReady 汇总四职责的功能点就绪，返回未就绪点清单（空 = 全部就绪）。\nfunc CheckReady() []string {\n\tvar missing []string\n\tmissing = append(missing, CheckPIInstalled()...)\n\tmissing = append(missing, CheckEcosystemExtensions()...)\n\tmissing = append(missing, CheckRickAgents()...)\n\tmissing = append(missing, CheckRickHooks()...)\n\treturn missing\n}\n\n// CheckPIInstalled 检查 pi agent 是否可用（托管 runtime 二进制或 PATH pi）。\n// 就绪返回 nil，否则返回缺失描述。\nfunc CheckPIInstalled() []string {\n\tif runtime.FileExists(runtime.RuntimeBin()) {\n\t\treturn nil\n\t}\n\tif _, err := exec.LookPath(\"pi\"); err == nil {\n\t\treturn nil\n\t}\n\treturn []string{\"pi runtime not installed\"}\n}\n\n// CheckEcosystemExtensions 检查 pi 生态扩展（pi-subagents/pi-web-access）是否\n// 注册。就绪返回 nil，缺失时返回未注册扩展名。\nfunc CheckEcosystemExtensions() []string {\n\treturn VerifyExtensions()\n}\n\n// CheckRickAgents 检查 rick 自定义 agent（think/research/exporter）是否落盘。\n// task3 无必需 agent，恒为就绪；task9 注册后检查对应文件。\nfunc CheckRickAgents() []string {\n\tvar missing []string\n\tfor _, name := range requiredRickAgents {\n\t\tif !runtime.FileExists(filepath.Join(runtime.AgentDir(), \"agents\", name)) {\n\t\t\tmissing = append(missing, name)\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\treturn missing\n}\n\n// CheckRickHooks 检查 rick-gates ho