{"type":"message_update","assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"thinking_end","contentIndex":0,"content":"Now there might be a subtle issue: `TestExecuteDoingWorkflow_ResumesFromTasksJSON` and `TestExecuteDoingWorkflow_WithMockPi` set PATH with the mock \"pi\" prepended. But they set `t.Setenv(\"HOME\", dir)` already (for config), so RuntimeBin won't resolve to real pi. With mock \"pi\" on PATH first, `exec.Command(\"pi\", ...)` → fake pi exits 0 → parseStream gets empty → returns nil session. Good.\n\nBut wait — does the fake pi need to handle `--mode json` and produce output? No. The executor calls `parseStream` on stdout which will immediately EOF (fake pi produces no output and exits 0). So parseStream returns sess with empty fields, no error. Then GenerateTestWithAgent checks for test script creation — not created → task fails → retry.\n\nActually wait, let me check what `parseStream` does on empty stream — does it error? Let me check executor.go parseStream."}}
