*: `/workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick/.rick/jobs/job_35/doing`\n- **Plan 目录**: `/workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick/.rick/jobs/job_35/plan`\n- **Tasks JSON**: `/workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick/.rick/jobs/job_35/doing/tasks.json`\n\n## 当前任务状态快照（启动时读取）\n\n```json\n{\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-08-17T00:59:46.783995764+08:00\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-08-17T00:59:46.784197798+08:00\",\n  \"tasks\": [\n    {\n      \"task_id\": \"task1\",\n      \"task_name\": \"定义 spec 规范与「spec → 开发计划 → 功能等价实现」验收标准\",\n      \"status\": \"running\",\n      \"dependencies\": null,\n      \"attempts\": 0,\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-08-17T00:59:46.783995764+08:00\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"2026-08-17T00:59:46.784197736+08:00\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"task_id\": \"task2\",\n      \"task_name\": \"产出 rick 第一份 spec（四层架构 + 5 模块 + env 四职责契约）\",\n      \"status\": \"pending\",\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"task1\"\n      ],\n      \"attempts\": 0,\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-08-17T00:59:46.783995764+08:00\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"2026-08-17T00:59:46.783995764+08:00\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"task_id\": \"task4\",\n      \"task_name\": \"重构 runtime 模块（pi 调用逻辑收口到 runtime 层）\",\n      \"status\": \"pending\",\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"task2\"\n      ],\n      \"attempts\": 0,\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-08-17T00:59:46.783995764+08:00\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"2026-08-17T00:59:46.783995764+08:00\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"task_id\": \"task5\",\n      \"task_name\": \"重构 builder 三件（templates + pibuilder + xxxxbuilder），注入路径而非内容\",\n      \"status\": \"pending\",\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"task2\"\n      ],\n      \"attempts\": 0,\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-08-17T00:59:46.783995764+08:00\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"2026-08-17T00:59:46.783995764+08:00\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"task_id\": \"task3\",\n      \"task_name\": \"落地 env 模块（四职责：pi + 生态扩展 + rick 定制 + 就绪 check）\",\n      \"status\": \"pending\",\n      \"dependencies\": [\n     